DEFINE COMPONENT notes-round-update
DESCRIPTION Round {{round}}: the notes so far and the next stored results

QUESTION AND CONTRIBUTIONS:
{{context}}

WORKING NOTES SO FAR:
{{notes}}

NEW STORED RESULTS (round {{round}}):
{{batch}}

WHEN you reply THEN write the updated working notes in the notes format
ALWAYS keep every finding already in the notes and add the findings of the new results
WHEN a new result shows a finding wrong THEN correct it and write the reason on that line
NEVER drop a finding without a reason written on its line
